# Frontend

Use Next.js App Router.

Use Server Components whenever possible.

Use Client Components only when necessary.

Use Suspense.

Use Lazy Loading.

Use Dynamic Imports.

Use shadcn/ui.

Responsive First.

Mobile First.

Accessibility Required.

SEO Optimized.

Reusable Components.

Use TailwindCSS.

Use React Hook Form.

Use Zod.

Never use inline styles.

Never hardcode colors.

Never hardcode spacing.

Place feature code under `src/features/<feature>/` with colocated components, hooks, types, services, api, utils, and validation.

Keep pages thin — compose from feature components and server data loaders.

Use `@/` import alias consistently.
